    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96470" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στενάζω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pr.</u>
			696
		</span></i>, etc.: fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.259
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				973
			</span></i>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνα-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				656
			</span></i> (lyr.): aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστέναξα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					33.6
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστέναγμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					412
				</span></i>
			:—prop. Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στένω</span>, <i>sigh deeply</i>: generally, <i>sigh,
			groan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1046
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eu.</u>
				788
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				917
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἄτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					1299
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. κακοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					199
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκοις</span>
			<i>in</i> the house, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1035
			</span></i> (lyr.); freq. with a neut. Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκτρόν, δεινὸν ς</span>., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Med.</u>
				1184
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>IT</u>
				957
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.69
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί ἐστέναξας τοῦτο</span>; why
				<i>utteredst thou</i> this <i>moan?</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				550
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιᾶνα ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				578
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				753
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρὰς τέκνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					334
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηλίκον τί ποτ᾽ ἂν
				στενάξειαν</span>; <i><span class="en">
				D.
				23.210
			</span></i>. </div>
