				1672
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1640
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ba.</u>
				1027
			</span></i>.</div>
